'''The Widow's Nest''' is a mine located within the [[Forlorn Summit]], in the [[Eastern Plaguelands]]. It is the lair of [[High Widow Arania]] and her brood of undead spiders. The mine was the site of the remaining defenders' last stand when the outpost was overrun, led by the paladin [[Leonid Barthalomew]], who fell to the undead forces here.<ref>{{questlong|Neutral|55|Vigilant Last Defender}}</ref>

